Subject: [PATCH] netfilter: retain AP10 bridge crossing, DSCP and PPE flow semantics

Consolidated from the deployed AP5 bridge/DSCP fixes retained in AP10.
Requires a coherent kernel and complete kernel-module rebuild.

--- a/include/net/flow_dissector.h
+++ b/include/net/flow_dissector.h
@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@
 
 	/* These flags are internal to the kernel */
 	FLOW_DIS_ENCAPSULATION		= (TCA_FLOWER_KEY_FLAGS_MAX << 1),
+	FLOW_DIS_IS_BRIDGED		= (TCA_FLOWER_KEY_FLAGS_MAX << 2),
 };
 
